description	"11th Brother (The Crow)

A Ruthless Inquisitor with heightened Force and physical Prowess.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- Cripples
-- 10% Faster Swings
- Inquisitor Lightsaber (Staff/Red Style Saber)
-- Cripples/Staggers/Ignites On Hit
-- Extremely High Saber Damage
-- 100% More Special Damage
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Defense (3)
-- Deflect (2)
-- Saber Throw (2)
-- 40 Saber Throw Damage
- Flame Grenades (2)

^5Force Powers:
- Push (3) ^3[CS2]
- Jump (2)
- Repulse (1) ^3[CS4]
- Sense (1)

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armor
- Armor Regen (1)
- Grounded (Anti-MT)
- Health Regen Capped At 35
- Increased Melee Special Knockback
- Heavy Footing (Takes 25% less knockback)
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (2)
- Tracking Beacon
- Environmential Protection (1)
- 15% Faster Cooldowns

^3Abilities:
- Poison Darts (6) ^3[CS3]"